{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20991","headline":"苦篁调啸引 · 李贺","name":"苦篁调啸引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"请说轩辕在时事，伶伦采竹二十四。\n伶伦采之自崑丘，轩辕诏遣中分作十二。\n伶伦以之正音律，轩辕以之调元气。\n当时黄帝上天时，二十三管咸相随。\n唯留一管人间吹，无德不能得此管，此管沈埋虞舜祠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}